{"code":"nl","quarters":[{"id":"2026-02","title":"Groeien in een relatie met God","description":"Of je nu bent opgegroeid als zevendedagsadventist of nieuw bent in het geloof; of je veel of weinig lessen uit Dialoog hebt gelezen; en tenslotte, waar je je ook bevindt op je geestelijke reis: het onderwerp van groeien in een betekenisvolle relatie met G","human_date":"Tweede kwartaal van 2026","start_date":"28/03/2026","end_date":"26/06/2025","color_primary":"#485D2E","color_primary_dark":"#30421B","splash":true,"credits":[],"lessons":[{"number":1,"title":"Check met de realiteit","start_date":"28/03/2026","end_date":"03/04/2026"},{"number":2,"title":"God kennen","start_date":"04/04/2026","end_date":"10/04/2026"},{"number":3,"title":"Trots tegenover nederigheid","start_date":"11/04/2026","end_date":"17/04/2026"},{"number":4,"title":"De rol van de Bijbel","start_date":"18/04/2026","end_date":"24/04/2026"},{"number":5,"title":"Hoe bestudeer ik de Bijbel","start_date":"25/04/2026","end_date":"01/05/2026"},{"number":6,"title":"Gebedshelden","start_date":"02/05/2026","end_date":"08/05/2026"},{"number":7,"title":"Praktisch bidden","start_date":"09/05/2026","end_date":"15/05/2026"},{"number":8,"title":"Geloof hebben","start_date":"16/05/2026","end_date":"22/05/2026"},{"number":9,"title":"Zonde en het evangelie en de wet","start_date":"23/05/2026","end_date":"29/05/2026"},{"number":10,"title":"Bekering en vergeving","start_date":"30/05/2026","end_date":"05/06/2026"},{"number":11,"title":"Terugval","start_date":"06/06/2026","end_date":"12/06/2026"},{"number":12,"title":"Vertel over Hem","start_date":"13/06/2026","end_date":"19/06/2026"},{"number":13,"title":"Tot in eeuwigheid","start_date":"20/06/2026","end_date":"26/06/2026"}]},{"id":"2026-03","title":"1 en 2 Korintiërs","description":"Jezus komt snel. Deze tijd vraagt om een- heid in Christus, om een ongeëvenaarde openheid voor de heilige Geest, om een ijverig gebruik van onze geestelijke gaven en voor een diepgaande wandel met onze opgestane Heer. Nu is de tijd om als chris- tenen aan de slag te gaan, dienstbaar te zijn als rentmeesters en zendelingen, geestelijk oorlog te voeren tegen onjuiste leerstel- lingen en te groeien in genade, liefde en onderlinge eenheid. Nu is de tijd om ons vast te klampen en trouw te zijn aan de boodschap van het kruis. De brieven van Paulus aan de Korintiërs leren ons dat te doen.","human_date":"Derde kwartaal van 2026","start_date":"27/06/2026","end_date":"25/06/2026","color_primary":"#2A1F1A","color_primary_dark":"#120D0A","splash":true,"credits":[],"lessons":[{"number":1,"title":"Paulus zendingswerk in Korinthe","start_date":"27/06/2026","end_date":"03/07/2026"},{"number":2,"title":"De boodschap over het kruis","start_date":"04/07/2026","end_date":"10/07/2026"},{"number":3,"title":"Eenheid in Christus","start_date":"11/07/2026","end_date":"17/07/2026"},{"number":4,"title":"Zonde in de kerk","start_date":"18/07/2026","end_date":"24/07/2026"},{"number":5,"title":"Alles tot eer van God","start_date":"25/07/2026","end_date":"31/07/2026"},{"number":6,"title":"Geestelijke gaven","start_date":"01/08/2026","end_date":"07/08/2026"},{"number":7,"title":"Een portret van liefde","start_date":"08/08/2026","end_date":"14/08/2026"},{"number":8,"title":"De macht van Christus zijn opstanding","start_date":"15/08/2026","end_date":"21/08/2026"},{"number":9,"title":"Bediening gedreven door liefde","start_date":"22/08/2026","end_date":"28/08/2026"},{"number":10,"title":"Authentieke christelijke bediening","start_date":"29/08/2026","end_date":"04/09/2026"},{"number":11,"title":"Rentmeesterschap en zendingswerk","start_date":"05/09/2026","end_date":"11/09/2026"},{"number":12,"title":"Valse leraren","start_date":"12/09/2026","end_date":"18/09/2026"},{"number":13,"title":" Genade - liefde en verbondenheid","start_date":"19/09/2026","end_date":"25/09/2026"}]},{"id":"2026-01","title":"Hemel en aarde met elkaar verbinden","description":"Dit kwartaal bestuderen we de brieven van Paulus aan de Filippenzen en de Kolossen- zen. Ze hebben belangrijke overeenkomsten. Die brieven openbaren ons vooral Christus, de enige die hemel en aarde met elkaar kan verbinden. Hij is de ladder die Jakob zag,","human_date":"Eerste kwartaal van 2026","start_date":"27/12/2025","end_date":"27/03/2025","color_primary":"#2E2B7B","color_primary_dark":"#17145F","splash":true,"credits":[],"lessons":[{"number":1,"title":"Vervolgd maar niet in de steek gelaten","start_date":"27/12/2025","end_date":"02/01/2026"},{"number":2,"title":"Redenen voor dankzegging en gebed","start_date":"03/01/2026","end_date":"09/01/2026"},{"number":3,"title":"Leven en dood","start_date":"10/01/2026","end_date":"16/01/2026"},{"number":4,"title":"Eenheid door nederigheid","start_date":"17/01/2026","end_date":"23/01/2026"},{"number":5,"title":"Schijnen als een licht in de nacht","start_date":"24/01/2026","end_date":"30/01/2026"},{"number":6,"title":"Alleen vertrouwen hebben in Christus","start_date":"31/01/2026","end_date":"06/02/2026"},{"number":7,"title":"Een hemels burgerschap","start_date":"07/02/2026","end_date":"13/02/2026"},{"number":8,"title":"De voortreffelijkheid van Christus","start_date":"14/02/2026","end_date":"20/02/2026"},{"number":9,"title":"Verzoening en hoop","start_date":"21/02/2026","end_date":"27/02/2026"},{"number":10,"title":"Compleet in Christus","start_date":"28/02/2026","end_date":"06/03/2026"},{"number":11,"title":"Leven met Christus","start_date":"07/03/2026","end_date":"13/03/2026"},{"number":12,"title":"Samenleven met elkaar","start_date":"14/03/2026","end_date":"20/03/2026"},{"number":13,"title":"Volmaakt vasthouden aan alles wat God wil","start_date":"21/03/2026","end_date":"27/03/2026"}]},{"id":"2026-04","title":"De gave van profetie","description":"Dit kwartaal bestuderen we de gave van profetie, Gods ingenieuze uitvinding om zijn wil en weg te communiceren aan  gevallen mensen, die niet langer rechtstreeks met Hem kunnen communiceren. ","human_date":"Vierde kwartaal van 2026","start_date":"26/09/2026","end_date":"20/09/2026","color_primary":"#052643","color_primary_dark":"#052643","splash":false,"credits":[],"lessons":[{"number":1,"title":"De Schepper spreekt","start_date":"26/09/2026","end_date":"02/10/2026"},{"number":2,"title":"Het roepen van een profeet","start_date":"03/10/2026","end_date":"09/10/2026"},{"number":3,"title":"Oudtestamentische profeten","start_date":"10/10/2026","end_date":"16/10/2026"},{"number":4,"title":"Nieuwtestamentische profeten","start_date":"17/10/2026","end_date":"23/10/2026"},{"number":5,"title":"Openbaring en inspiratie","start_date":"24/10/2026","end_date":"30/10/2026"},{"number":6,"title":"De profetische geschriften","start_date":"31/10/2026","end_date":"06/11/2026"},{"number":7,"title":"Luister hiernaar","start_date":"07/11/2026","end_date":"13/11/2026"},{"number":8,"title":"Profetische geschriften interpreteren","start_date":"14/11/2026","end_date":"20/11/2026"},{"number":9,"title":"De profeten beproeven","start_date":"21/11/2026","end_date":"27/11/2026"},{"number":10,"title":"Profetische autoriteit en relevantie","start_date":"28/11/2026","end_date":"04/12/2026"},{"number":11,"title":"Profetische manifestaties op cruciale momenten","start_date":"05/12/2026","end_date":"11/12/2026"},{"number":12,"title":"Profetische openbaringen voor de eindtijd","start_date":"12/12/2026","end_date":"18/12/2026"},{"number":13,"title":"Zegeningen uit het profetische woord","start_date":"19/12/2026","end_date":"25/12/2026"}]}]}